## Protected Branches

`{{.ProtectedBranchesDesc}}` are **protected** in this sandbox. Do **not** commit on or push to them directly — coi's git hooks reject it. Work on a feature branch (`git switch -c <name>`), commit there, and open a pull request.
{{- end}}

